{"id":"f8f4015d1e8911d1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/12_小拟范畴.md","title":"小单纯集、内角与拟范畴","display":"小单纯集、内角与拟范畴","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","specification"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>specification</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"1.-直接集合定义\">1. 直接集合定义</h2>\n<p>DeltaArrow(m,n,f) 是有限序数 [m]=m+1 到 [n]=n+1 的保序函数图。X 是定义域 ω 的集合族；R 给每个 Δ 箭头指定反向的限制图 X(n)→X(m)。SimplicialSet 明确检查恒等与反向复合，不把“函子”作为元语言原语。每个 X(n) 允许为空。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缩写</th>\n<th>集合参数（按位置）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cb62239daefca4\" href=\"?note=44cb62239daefca4\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Identity\">Identity</a></td>\n<td><code>A, f</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"577620d5d7b63059\" href=\"?note=577620d5d7b63059\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Compose\">Compose</a></td>\n<td><code>g, f, h</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"214537992e13e711\" href=\"?note=214537992e13e711\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_DeltaArrow\">DeltaArrow</a></td>\n<td><code>m, n, f</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" href=\"?note=bf0c84a1c0d1d98b\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpRestriction\">SimpRestriction</a></td>\n<td><code>R, m, n, f, h</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"85c9ab4a34ec968f\" href=\"?note=85c9ab4a34ec968f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialSet\">SimplicialSet</a></td>\n<td><code>X, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58ce9246a7b5fc1b\" href=\"?note=58ce9246a7b5fc1b\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FaceInjection\">FaceInjection</a></td>\n<td><code>n, i, f</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6ead27971b185ffe\" href=\"?note=6ead27971b185ffe\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpFace\">SimpFace</a></td>\n<td><code>X, R, n, i, a, b</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"48e0b8a78d35938f\" href=\"?note=48e0b8a78d35938f\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_InnerHorn\">InnerHorn</a></td>\n<td><code>X, R, n, k, h</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"6b9047014ff57a68\" href=\"?note=6b9047014ff57a68\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory\">QuasiCategory</a></td>\n<td><code>X, R</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"49824451b79d11fa\" href=\"?note=49824451b79d11fa\" title=\"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialMap\">SimplicialMap</a></td>\n<td><code>X, R, Y, S, f</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>FaceInjection 从 n 映到 n+1，跳过 i。内角 n≥2、0&lt;k&lt;n，h 的域恰为 (n+1) 去掉 k，所有值在 X(n−1)。对 i&lt;j 的非缺失面，条件是 d_i(a_j)=d_{j−1}(a_i)。QuasiCategory 要求存在 X(n) 中的填充，不要求唯一。完全空的单纯集没有来自非空角域的 h，所以条件真；没有人为排除空对象。</p>\n<p>R、所有小族和每个固定源靶的映射都有集合界；这里没有“所有拟范畴的集合”。SimplicialMap 的自然性用图复合等式表达。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.-本次未恢复的部分\">2. 本次未恢复的部分</h2>\n<p>原 933 的单排序一阶关系展示、允许空排序的哑元处理及与直接集合定义的双向对应，尚未生成完整规范公式。原段落被保存为历史快照，而非原封保留并贴上“已通过 ZFC”的标签。933 的状态为 <strong>partial_core_only</strong>。</p>\n<p>有限面指标测试只检查所列低维恒等式/下标，不验证任意给定无限单纯对象满足所有内角填充，更不证明拟范畴与其他 (∞,1)-范畴模型之间的比较定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-直接集合定义","text":"1. 直接集合定义","level":2},{"id":"2.-本次未恢复的部分","text":"2. 本次未恢复的部分","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Identity","status":"resolved","id":"44cb62239daefca4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Identity|Identity]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Compose","status":"resolved","id":"577620d5d7b63059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_Compose|Compose]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_DeltaArrow","status":"resolved","id":"214537992e13e711","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_DeltaArrow|DeltaArrow]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpRestriction","status":"resolved","id":"bf0c84a1c0d1d98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpRestriction|SimpRestriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialSet","status":"resolved","id":"85c9ab4a34ec968f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialSet|SimplicialSet]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FaceInjection","status":"resolved","id":"58ce9246a7b5fc1b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FaceInjection|FaceInjection]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpFace","status":"resolved","id":"6ead27971b185ffe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimpFace|SimpFace]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_InnerHorn","status":"resolved","id":"48e0b8a78d35938f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_InnerHorn|InnerHorn]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory","status":"resolved","id":"6b9047014ff57a68","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_QuasiCategory|QuasiCategory]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialMap","status":"resolved","id":"49824451b79d11fa","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"1. 直接集合定义","excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SimplicialMap|SimplicialMap]]","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":2191,"backlinks":[{"id":"2a802213915eee42","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[12_小拟范畴]]"},{"id":"d203766cc7ddd76d","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"各参数的意义、构造子及局部条款见 [[000_ZFC/12_小拟范畴]]。纯语言约定见 [[000_ZFC/01_language]]，有限证明列的读法见 [[000_ZFC/02_proofs]]。"}],"outgoing":["44cb62239daefca4","577620d5d7b63059","214537992e13e711","bf0c84a1c0d1d98b","85c9ab4a34ec968f","58ce9246a7b5fc1b","6ead27971b185ffe","48e0b8a78d35938f","6b9047014ff57a68","49824451b79d11fa"]}